  "description": "Global keyboard shortcut registry for BlazOrbit. Document-level keydown listener (skips inputs / textareas / contentEditable), modifier-aware combo grammar, scope-aware registration (Global / Page) with auto-cleanup, and Program.cs-time wiring through `AddBlazOrbitHotkeys(opts => opts.Register(...))`. Ships its own JS interop module so the main library stays free of keyboard-handling overhead when not used.",
